  1+  0000              ; PROJECT126 NeoGS physical RAM allocation, revision 0.1
  2+  0000              ; 4 MiB physical RAM, divided into 256 pages of 16 KiB.
  3+  0000              ; Physical allocation only: not the Z80 logical 64 KiB window map.
