153+  087D              ; OUT: carry clear/A=0, HL=#C000 and BC=derived frame size; otherwise
154+  087D              ; carry set/A=status. Uses physical DMA page 42h (108000h), then maps it
155+  087D              ; into WIN3. The callable dispatcher below routes E0h to this endpoint.
